The "Subject operation" subsection of the Review stack: the review wave made parametric in its subject (ReviewSubjectSpec / FrozenSubject / freeze_subject / isolated_checkout under the data root), governance always from the installed body while the reviewers read the subject's own root or checkout, the system index kept byte-identical to the gate's path, and the three identities derived from the frozen subject (reuse key with settled-record reuse at $0, the rebuttal round under the common per-root ceiling, the pre-dispatch retry key) plus the per-surface ledger record builder.
